  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education for all  2015 - 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint programme between UNICEF, WFP and ILO on strengthening the education sector at primary level, through ensuring quality of teacher materials, teachers training, building of  cyclone proof classrooms and school cantine programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
